tals during an ambush at the Keep'},{'part':'Rebuilding the Keep','ruling':'The Keep cannot be placed again if removed.','evidence':'Marquise de Cat — Keep and Field Hospitals'}],'support':'supported','evidence':['Marquise de Cat — Keep and Field Hospitals','FAQ & Rulings — Field Hospitals during an ambush at the Keep']},
